WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:14.779
It was early morning in Metro City.

2
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.221
A pickup truck drove onto a construction site.

3
00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:21.843
Three workers got out of the truck.

4
00:00:23.784 --> 00:00:25.325
They were building a new skyscraper.

5
00:00:25.345 --> 00:00:30.808
"We have a lot of work to do today," said one man.

6
00:00:32.056 --> 00:00:33.678
Suddenly the workers heard something.

7
00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:37.921
Whirr! "What's that sound?"

8
00:00:38.262 --> 00:00:38.882
asked a woman.

9
00:00:39.863 --> 00:00:44.307
Whirr! "Look!"

10
00:00:44.607 --> 00:00:45.488
cried the other man.

11
00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:48.510
"The new skyscraper is shrinking!"

12
00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:54.215
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

13
00:00:55.016 --> 00:00:56.878
They walked past Rocky Mountain Bakery.

14
00:00:56.898 --> 00:00:59.380
"Mmm," said Mara.

15
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.042
"The bakery smells good!"

16
00:01:04.143 --> 00:01:07.165
"We should buy cookies after school," said Terrell.

17
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:09.887
"Good idea," said Jack.

18
00:01:09.907 --> 00:01:12.068
"Look," said Mara.

19
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:14.710
"It's the Metro City Movie Theater."

20
00:01:15.871 --> 00:01:17.752
Mara pointed to a very old building.

21
00:01:18.713 --> 00:01:19.974
Boards covered its windows.

22
00:01:20.995 --> 00:01:22.376
Cracks ran along the walls.

23
00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.257
Weeds grew in front of it.

24
00:01:25.177 --> 00:01:28.560
"It's sad that the old theater went out of business," said Jack.

25
00:01:29.532 --> 00:01:31.094
"I saw lots of movies there."

26
00:01:31.114 --> 00:01:33.996
"I did too," said Terrell.

27
00:01:34.016 --> 00:01:37.179
"But now there's a fancy new theater downtown.

28
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.761
It has 12 screens!

29
00:01:40.622 --> 00:01:41.983
It even has movies in 3-D!"

30
00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:46.587
"I saw lots of movies in the old theater too," said Mara.

31
00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:49.750
"But now my parents hope it gets knocked down."

32
00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:52.172
"Why?" asked Jack.

33
00:01:52.192 --> 00:01:56.816
"People want to plant a community garden on the lot," said Mara.

34
00:01:57.772 --> 00:01:59.953
"They want to grow fruits and vegetables there."

35
00:01:59.973 --> 00:02:03.175
"That would be cool," said Roxy.

36
00:02:03.195 --> 00:02:06.737
"A garden would look much nicer than that old building."

37
00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:08.478
Mara nodded.

38
00:02:08.498 --> 00:02:11.880
"But first workers need to knock it down."

39
00:02:13.461 --> 00:02:14.681
Terrell's eyes lit up.

40
00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:17.343
"They should get Rocket Girl to help!

41
00:02:18.243 --> 00:02:20.084
She could knock down the old theater!"

42
00:02:21.405 --> 00:02:22.505
Roxy rolled her eyes.

43
00:02:22.525 --> 00:02:26.808
"I'm sure Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

44
00:02:31.544 --> 00:02:32.485
Terrell frowned.

45
00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:34.546
"You're probably right.

46
00:02:35.687 --> 00:02:37.208
But I'm sure she could do it."

47
00:02:39.489 --> 00:02:41.151
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

48
00:02:41.851 --> 00:02:42.832
She looked at her friends.

49
00:02:42.852 --> 00:02:45.093
"Oh," said Roxy.

50
00:02:45.113 --> 00:02:47.435
"Did I bring my lunch money?"

51
00:02:48.696 --> 00:02:51.257
Roxy stopped walking and pretended to look in her backpack.

52
00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:53.859
She pressed a button on her watch.

53
00:02:53.879 --> 00:02:57.201
"Mayor Bloom," she said quietly.

54
00:02:57.221 --> 00:02:58.302
"What's up?"

55
00:02:59.423 --> 00:02:59.923
"Rocket Girl!"

56
00:03:00.423 --> 00:03:00.964
said the mayor.

57
00:03:01.996 --> 00:03:04.238
"Metro City's new skyscraper is gone!"

58
00:03:04.258 --> 00:03:05.839
"It's gone?"

59
00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.401
Roxy was confused.

60
00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:08.982
"What happened to it?"

61
00:03:09.002 --> 00:03:11.784
"It shrank and then disappeared!"

62
00:03:12.085 --> 00:03:12.685
said the mayor.

63
00:03:12.705 --> 00:03:15.628
"Workers saw a Oh no!"

64
00:03:15.648 --> 00:03:18.870
"Mayor Bloom!"

65
00:03:19.111 --> 00:03:19.811
said Roxy.

66
00:03:19.831 --> 00:03:21.132
"What's wrong?"

67
00:03:21.152 --> 00:03:23.294
"Help us, Rocket Girl!"

68
00:03:24.355 --> 00:03:26.557
Mayor Bloom's voice suddenly sounded tiny.

69
00:03:26.577 --> 00:03:27.778
"Help us!"

70
00:03:28.739 --> 00:03:30.100
"Mayor Bloom?

71
00:03:30.869 --> 00:03:31.530
Mayor Bloom?"

72
00:03:31.851 --> 00:03:32.633
cried Roxy.

73
00:03:33.636 --> 00:03:34.860
The mayor didn't answer.

74
00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.427
"Uh-oh," said Roxy.
